Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.50,0:08:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.51,0:08:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.51,0:08:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Бұл қиын.
