Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.57,0:09:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ах...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.57,0:09:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ха!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.58,0:09:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,(Танжиро) Тұр, тұр! Тоқта, Иносукэ~!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.58,0:09:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...
